# Tie levels of detail at the PS2's distances (the tie geomorph, c3l::ExtMorph): the title flight,
# Fire Canyon and village2. Each view: a "view" window (the [softstats] lines in it) and named shots.
# Host: CTR_SOFT_STATS=60 gk --ctr-gfx --ctr-dump DIR ...
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
1200 log view-begin title
1300 shot ps2lod_title_1300
1800 shot ps2lod_title_1800
2300 shot ps2lod_title_2300
2310 log view-end title
2320 continue firecanyon-start
2321 wait *target* target-continue
2322 wait *target* target-stance
2620 log view-begin firecanyon
2980 shot ps2lod_firecanyon
2981 log view-end firecanyon
2990 continue village2-start
2991 wait *target* target-continue
2992 wait *target* target-stance
3290 log view-begin village2
3650 shot ps2lod_village2
3651 log view-end village2
3660 exit
